5 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you Alt+Tab while doing some operations, not all editors will properly release them. I tested with collision shape editors (2D and 3D), but there might be more.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a CollisionShape2D or 3D and create shape resource\n2. Select the node and drag its size gizmo in the editor\n3. While dragging, Alt+Tab so the editor loses focus\n4. While the window is not focused, you can see that the dragging operation continues\n5. If you click on another scene tab, the editor may crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110359/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}